## API (when server running)

- `GET /api/manuscript/modules` — list modules and playbook
- `POST /api/manuscript/module/:id` — run a single module
- `POST /api/manuscript/chapter` — run full chapter loop
- `POST /api/manuscript/pipeline` — run end-to-end pipeline
- `POST /api/manuscript/meta-prompt` — forge bespoke XML modules

## Temperature Guidelines

